        {
          "text": " Omuri egyo shanduukye tihaine kindi ekyabaire kibamu, kureka ebishate by'amabaare bibiri, ebi Musa yaateereiremu ahari Horebu, ahu Musa yaaraganiire n'Abaisraeli endagaano nibaruga omu nsi ya Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
