        {
          "text": " kandi abeeshongozi Abaleevi boona, Asafu, Hamani na Yedusuuni, hamwe na batabani baabo na beene waabo, bajwaire emyenda ya bafuta, baine ebitaasa n'enanga n'endingiri, baayemerera aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba rw'eitambiro hamwe n'abanyamurwa abarikuteera amakondere igana na makumi abiri; ",
